===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|sa|iir-pro|*máHtā||mother}}, from {{inh|sa|ine-pro|*méh₂tēr||mother}}. Cognate with {{cog|ae|𐬨𐬁𐬙𐬀𐬭}}, {{cog|peo|𐎶𐎠𐎫𐎠|ts=mātā}}, {{cog|xcl|մայր}}, {{cog|grc|μήτηρ}}, {{cog|cu|мати}}, {{cog|la|māter}}, {{cog|ang|mōdor}} (whence {{cog|en|mother}}).

