{{sa-noun|g=f|tr=mā́tṛ|tr2=mātṛ́}}

# [[mother]]
#* {{Q|sa||RV|7|55|1|quote=सस्तु '''माता''' सस्तु पिता सस्तु श्वा सस्तु विश्पतिः ।<br>ससन्तु सर्वे ज्ञातयः सस्त्वयमभितो जनः ॥|t=May '''the mother''' sleep, may the father sleep, may the dog and the village chief sleep.<br>Let all the kinsmen and all the people who are round about sleep.}}

